        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the fascinating world of bright crystals and inexorably melting time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where time is not sand, but ice that melts before your eyes, only you can restore the course of history! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a unique puzzle game where familiar mechanics meets a wildly ticking clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run faster than time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main weapon and main enemy is time. It is inexorably melting away, and if you let it run out, you will lose. Remember, every successful combination adds precious seconds to your watch! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect chains, plan your moves, and feel the adrenaline rush of trying to outrun an invisible opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complete the level, you need to collect the required number of stones indicated on the right side of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the left mouse button to move the stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20 challenging levels;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game bonuses that will always help in a difficult moment;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game is suitable for the whole family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic journey awaits you through 20 fascinating levels, each of which is a new chapter in the history of a world on the verge of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to challenge fate? Collect the combination before the time runs out!</p>",
